WEBVTT

00:03:59.026 --> 00:04:00.152
which is MTV.

00:04:00.569 --> 00:04:01.904
(Laughs)

00:04:01.946 --> 00:04:06.450
There had been a made-for-TV movie

00:04:06.492 --> 00:04:10.579
called "Carmen: A Hip Hopera," on MTV.

00:04:10.579 --> 00:04:11.747
I loved it.

00:04:11.789 --> 00:04:13.040
It starred Beyoncé.

00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:15.501
Now I thought it was magical,

00:04:15.543 --> 00:04:19.297
because, I mean, who the hell
puts hip-hop and opera together?

00:04:20.631 --> 00:04:22.216
It's fascinating.

00:04:23.467 --> 00:04:26.637
So, I put my vote on Beyoncé.

00:04:26.679 --> 00:04:28.848
Now of course, today,
everybody would be like,

00:04:28.848 --> 00:04:31.767
"Well, of course, that makes
so much sense, why wouldn't you?